rences in the relationship of glucose concentrations and hemoglobin A1c levels. Annals of Internal Medicine. 2017;167(2):95–102. 10. Selvin E. Are there clinical implications of racial differences in HbA1c? A difference, to be a difference, must make a difference. Diabetes Care. 2016;39(8):1462–1467. 11. Vandorsten JP, Dodson WC, Espeland MA, et al. NIH consensus development conference: diagnosing gestational diabetes mellitus. NIH Consensus and State-of-the-Science Statements. 2013;29(1):1–31. GUIDING PRINCIPLES FOR THE CARE OF PEOPLE WITH OR AT RISK FOR DIABETES | PRINCIPLE 1',`page`:13,`page_start`:13,`page_end`:13,`section`:'PDF page 13',`source_file`:'Guiding-Principles.pdf',`source_type`:'pdf',`source_version`:'40a7da28c688',`embedding`:[0.5739711596799159,0.31078145435533505,0.13743655765267848,-0.1837894530535986,-0.040411303941581406,0.17692775502209523,-0.08886683664125947,0.0890969350861061,-0.050988962782435976,-0.03923327666508407,-0.09264971870113757,-0.07228382994210235,0.05570815575254492,0.13701570103868035,-0.07028280052132786,0.09288302524314412,-0.007407576350544798,-0.18229040628975965,-0.018151545058963443,-0.010988353843937381,0.00021898083750421785,-0.04873514501613152,0.0776251473455659,0.05826617147756926,0.030347377987169345,-0.02137051346223533,-0.07789185576380163,-0.05963508739287684,-0.06549431493086515,-0.10447683870527569,-0.08503105798935483,0.028107230815034225,-0.024783959063304016,-0.15606854426750089,0.026361907183149954,0.021849208368745678,0.1773446148843071,0.07615419337256875,0.11793994698946739,-0.06059862002598817,0.13339745097882005,0.04121719389384713,0.013261208268328595,0.08883187298190519,0.0916561237716108,-0.10806248303207115,0.016379192153996015,-0.05660568492263225,0.03813421095890934,-0.02387183128640402,-0.12095429361768353,-0.025301816796186684,-0.0997587913711278,-0.055713282803890644,0.06166473298195693,-0.04360455233669025,-0.043371392221342384,0.07258678315126073,0.08216122084499985,-0.1013062377419463,0.02