d`:'chunk_f41b60506e13fccef2c52c03',`document_id`:'summary_idf2025_diet_association_001_154fa9265446',`title`:'IDF 2025 - Mối liên quan giữa thực phẩm và nguy cơ type 2 - Trang 26',`url`:'https://idf.org/media/uploads/2025/05/IDF_Rec_2025.pdf',`text`:'IDF 2025 tổng hợp nhiều phân tích hệ thống về chế độ ăn và tỷ lệ mới mắc đái tháo đường type 2. Chế độ ăn có tải lượng đường huyết cao, tiêu thụ nhiều thịt đỏ, thịt chế biến sẵn và đồ uống có đường có mối liên quan với nguy cơ cao hơn. Ngược lại, tiêu thụ ngũ cốc nguyên hạt, thực phẩm giàu chất xơ, chất béo thực vật và protein thực vật được liên hệ với nguy cơ thấp hơn. Ăn chay cũng liên quan tỷ lệ mắc thấp hơn trong nghiên cứu quan sát. Đây là mối liên quan quần thể, không chứng minh một thực phẩm đơn lẻ sẽ gây hoặc ngăn bệnh.',`page`:null,`page_start`:null,`page_end`:null,`section`:'IDF 2025 - Mối liên quan giữa thực phẩm và nguy cơ type 2 - Trang 26',`source_file`:null,`source_type`:'curated_summary',`source_version`:'154fa9265446',`embedding`:[0.129605916485712,0.15803531002107707,0.41080999856277667,0.434636254211096,0.5872465120434798,-0.006959509650710866,0.14587747428466277,-0.05957272964685128,-0.12361404289999578,-0.016192742941407004,-0.04627016556076101,-0.06100583626514289,0.014164576838004568,-0.024134327461549875,-0.03587088246036185,-0.057304818015623,0.027202314166720126,0.009448949582238781,0.014731434801057961,0.006601550806393762,0.01815691293443261,0.015440871507913448,-0.05916170415472182,0.028151177893179002,-0.0258491080884124,0.028269722724427102,0.04704073843217208,0.04363122438416212,-0.042932739417448594,0.004038454117575034,-0.026191909294729313,0.009921253696338221,-0.020051479125704368,-0.02675029943330333,-0.015968973111411214,0.009305003829418132,-0.02991288929853529,-0.013226838722033677,0.05699242724326015,0.013370262612391687,0.023018049850164254,0.025368547342571806,-0.024086170137961584,0.031344198037582,-0.06602793175340683,0.059391758690312955,0.03386540905017254,0.045055092198943866,-0.03184032824566709,-0.00952581331982647,0.021711669293908956,0.008592763681294035,-0.04119871747093425,0.06996560570680539,-0.04393031745152794,0.04256720612002346,-0.030523414217806123,-0.032639212833431026,0.09151387146509832,0.06950869452899834,-0.02438002576152841,-0.03488447566131881,0.055009463523697906,0.028247669494614824,0.005778995022382409,0.030235746513919838,0.016023316455060308,0.0010879833111823792,0.12458719810607066,-0.05791987643588228,-0.08102973168179135,-0.013766142724468284,0.03736305781426664,0.015131096856910468,0.07292706726982504,0.06557548293951243,0.00778626859782744,0.09585020087120247,-0.09129098658504277,-0.037011150106543926,0.029996265349232193,-0.034662755703707665,0.02166770814918292,0.015711659404599978,-0.028764560092765762,-0.05038294658593947,-0.000984673534185847,0.023275531051102027,-0.04766522878049833,-0.055696106131885595,0.07905024505696591,0.018518744740300172,-0.04101268975120653,0.016766706936543776,-0.0029050065223821834,-0.001732522273667895,-0.02305060655451115,0.0036977467149003707,-0.046659317432964496,0.032556132445778936,-0.0605394261031858,-0.021016860168115763,-0.051526827389250046,0.02930817188644544,0.04418072263037849,-0.02488747400964352,0.04364982971655272,-0.027912626227882466,-0.03317905167305566,-0.04086421563473418,0.06801959956847568,0.08505840066589794,0.0797255744060465,-0.001109268178856023,0.039351570374758615,0.0029384670974818613,-0.04010717114584875,0.05389558443062174,0.04108299168241588,0.03712060149335783,-0.016221387634222317,-0.02820350090368858,-0.031868408173253926,-0.028203269157666806,-0.04002862631921237,-0.08088509493603277,0.04096930933778353,-0.011188366426100712]},{`id`:'chunk_c57d0be9f9d650ee2d677960',`document_id`:'summary_idf2025_population_prevention_001_5de91558e3db',`title`:'IDF 2025 - Phòng ngừa type 2 ở cấp cộng đồng - Trang 28',`url`:'https://idf.org/media/uploads/2025/05/IDF_Rec_2025.pdf',`text`:'IDF 2025 nêu hai hướng phòng ngừa type 2 bổ trợ nhau: tập trung vào người có nguy cơ cao và cải thiện yếu tố nguy cơ trong toàn cộng đồng. Biện pháp cộng đồng gồm ăn uống lành mạnh, vận động đều, giảm hút thuốc, hạn chế đồ uống có đường và cải thiện môi trường vận động. Tài liệu còn nêu giáo dục sức khỏe và an ninh thực phẩm. IDF thừa nhận một số chương trình triển khai thực tế đạt mức giảm cân thấp hơn thử nghiệm ngẫu nhiên và còn thiếu số liệu về tỷ lệ mới mắc type 2. Vì vậy không nên gán hiệu quả thử nghiệm cho mọi chương trình.',`page`:null,`page_start`:null,`page_end`:null,`section`:'IDF 2025 - Phòng ngừa type 2 ở cấp cộng đồng - Trang 28',`source_file`:null,`source_type`:'curated_summary',`source_version`:'5de91558e3db',`embedding`:[0.127233863586658,0.1644392443910923,0.43511518618357004,0.4535994657525477,0.600088633353616,-0.0075286968151691116,0.16106597680102488,-0.06596270635473796,-0.1371072516833626,-0.0277956144219531,-0.025438531832249006,-0.06936299230094581,0.02045311838633551,-0.029906341784656856,-0.029321432050530873,-0.0346359864285116,0.034540657646752786,0.0176649458499393,0.0036645820530869415,-0.013592752390257427,0.00518756284262584,0.012267408299638302,-0.029129374823262767,0.04799787243186123,-0.03204524200280497,0.02493210872308816,0.03424441682890118,0.05219077354160282,-0.0469242193671204,-0.020754556086077926,-0.014386837956244625,-0.007161933356351419,-0.019519739307812808,-0.018972275017519538,-0.004396973354780476,0.00959069365542754,-0.03648462312566766,-0.011594322666147194,0.05556174548545763,0.0063234578935614525,0.008937572526418327,0.03304396030923079,-0.019761222804719907,0.0415203298756065,-0.09216060140432132,0.04292416170854753,-0.002009389496402445,0.04471790857245258,-0.019812232294304122,0.006824781025619768,0.005268367593483002,-0.00516809980882104,-0.05202945291060332,0.042543469929766084,-0.0348824372441919,0.014574048497881648,-0.021319453603073493,-0.05116236347676924,0.07527793483122958,0.07827125863686468,-0.0005745017743730315,-0.029934074153110207,0.0815926321303104,0.032961